Data Breach & Account Security
Account Takeover Prevention​

Food delivery apps are prime targets for account fraud:

Session management: Simultaneous logins from different locations flagged, session tokens expire appropriately

Password security: Bcrypt/Argon2 hashing, minimum complexity requirements, breach detection

Two-factor authentication: SMS or authenticator app 2FA for account changes

Suspicious activity detection: Multiple failed login attempts, orders from unusual locations, payment method changes

PII protection: Customer addresses, phone numbers, payment info encrypted at rest and in transit​

Performance & Scalability Testing
Peak Load Handling

Elite teams simulate real-world peak scenarios:

Lunch/dinner rush: 10x normal order volume handled without degradation

Flash sale stress test: Promotional campaigns causing order spikes

Database connection pooling: No connection exhaustion under high load

Queue worker scaling: Background jobs (order processing, notifications) scale horizontally

API rate limiting: Third-party API calls throttled to avoid blocking​

